		{"id":"e0dcea1c055ce058","type":"text","text":"### schema for DDLs in mongo store.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"_id\": \"ent_customers_001\",\n  \"source_id\": \"src_postgres_prod_01\",\n  \"entity_name\": \"customers\",\n  \"entity_type\": \"table\",\n  \"columns\": [\n    {\n      \"col_id\": \"col_cust_id\",\n      \"name\": \"customer_id\",\n      \"data_type\": \"INTEGER\",\n      \"nullable\": false,\n      \"is_primary_key\": true,\n      \"is_foreign_key\": false,\n      \"position\": 1\n    },\n    {\n      \"col_id\": \"col_email\",\n      \"name\": \"email\",\n      \"data_type\": \"VARCHAR(255)\",\n      \"nullable\": false,\n      \"is_unique\": true,\n      \"position\": 2\n    }\n  ],\n  \n  \"primary_key\": {\n    \"constraint_name\": \"pk_customers\",\n    \"columns\": [\"customer_id\"]\n  },\n  \n  \"indexes\": [\n    {\n      \"name\": \"idx_email\",\n      \"columns\": [\"email\"],\n      \"is_unique\": true\n    }\n  ],\n  \n  \"raw_ddl\": \"CREATE TABLE customers (...)\",\n  \n  \"metadata\": {\n    \"row_count\": 150000,\n    \"created_at\": ISODate(\"2024-01-15T00:00:00Z\"),\n    \"extracted_at\": ISODate(\"2025-02-08T10:30:00Z\")\n  }\n}\n```","x":-1360,"y":-430,"width":559,"height":554,"color":"1"}
